# SHA-256 digests of the toolchain archives that CI, the release jobs and the Sandbox image download.
#
# Every script and workflow that downloads one of these files checks it with scripts/verify-toolchain.sh
# before unpacking or running it, and fails when the digest differs or the file has no line here. The format is
# sha256sum's: a digest, two spaces and the file name. To move to a new version, change the version where it is
# set (the workflow or script, .node-version, Dockerfile.sandbox) and add the new file's digest here, taken from
# the publisher's signed checksum list and checked against a download.
#
# https://github.com/llvm/llvm-project/releases/download/llvmorg-22.1.8/
df0e1ecf16caf3489a272a5eea4eec9b0d82878f6477fa309504f918a0006384  LLVM-22.1.8-Linux-X64.tar.xz
805efad2bb91cb4967fa569e0881d10c0f69c04461cf671cccbae19f547acc34  LLVM-22.1.8-Linux-ARM64.tar.xz
d96c2cc1736f4eb7fa43cb9bbdf56d93551a9ae0a9aadb9c99c3c3b2b712a234  clang+llvm-22.1.8-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc.tar.xz
922f1817a0df7b1489272d18134ee0087a8b068828f87ac63b9861b1a9965888  llvm-project-22.1.8.src.tar.xz
